### Get player by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/player/{{playerId}}
Accept: application/json

### Get player heroes
GET {{baseUrl}}/player/{{playerId}}/heroes
Accept: application/json

### Get match details
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches/details/{{matchId}}
Accept: application/json

### Get match chat and word counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/match/{{matchId}}/chat
Accept: application/json

### Get match ward logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/match/{{matchId}}/wards
Accept: application/json

### Get live matches
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches/live?limit=10
Accept: application/json
